<header class="ds-hero">
    <div class="container ds-hero-inner">
        <div class="ds-hero-copy">
            <p class="term-eyebrow"><span class="term-prompt">&gt;</span> /ciencia-de-datos</p>
            <h1>Tus datos ya generan señales. Hoy las usamos para decidir.</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                Ayudamos a PyMEs a convertir datos dispersos en dashboards,
                pronósticos y automatizaciones que se usan en semanas, no en
                años.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-cta">
                <a
                    href="https://calendar.app.google/4occ12N5XGe6aqYf8"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="btn-primary">Agendar reunión de 15/30 min.</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ds-panel" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="ds-panel-head">
                <span>Cuadro de decisiones</span>
                <span class="ds-live"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> en vivo</span>
            </div>

            <div class="ds-kpis">
                <div class="ds-kpi">
                    <span class="ds-kpi-value">+40%</span>
                    <span class="ds-kpi-label">precisión en pronóstico de demanda</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ds-kpi">
                    <span class="ds-kpi-value">-30%</span>
                    <span class="ds-kpi-label">costos operativos detectados</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ds-kpi">
                    <span class="ds-kpi-value">2x</span>
                    <span class="ds-kpi-label">velocidad de decisión</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ds-chart">
                <div class="ds-chart-head">
                    <span>Ventas vs. pronóstico</span>
                    <span class="ds-mon">MES</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ds-bars">
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 100%; --d: 0s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 92%; --d: 0.06s;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 72%; --d: 0.12s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 70%; --d: 0.18s;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 88%; --d: 0.24s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 84%; --d: 0.3s;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 56%; --d: 0.36s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 62%; --d: 0.42s;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 94%; --d: 0.48s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 90%; --d: 0.54s;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 66%; --d: 0.6s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 68%; --d: 0.66s;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 78%; --d: 0.72s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 76%; --d: 0.78s;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ds-bar-g">
                        <span class="ds-bar-actual" style="--h: 60%; --d: 0.84s;"></span>
                        <span class="ds-bar-pro" style="--h: 64%; --d: 0.9s;"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="ds-legend">
                    <span><i class="ds-dot ds-dot-actual"></i> Ventas</span>
                    <span><i class="ds-dot ds-dot-pro"></i> Pronóstico</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ds-flow">
                <div class="ds-flow-step"><i class="fas fa-database"></i> ERP</div>
                <span class="ds-flow-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <div class="ds-flow-step"><i class="fas fa-broom"></i> Limpieza</div>
                <span class="ds-flow-arrow">&#8594;</span>
                <div class="ds-flow-step"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> Dashboard</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>